# Changelog

## [Unreleased]

### Added

- Example `Azure-AI-Foundry-Classic` demonstrating how to create an AI Foundry Hub and Project using the "classic" Cognitive Services model.

## [0.1.0] - 2026-02-16

### Added

- Initial release of the OpenAI/Cognitive Services AVM wrapper.
- Support for all 39 input variables from the official module version 0.11.0.
- Support for all 11 outputs from the official module.
- Standard AVM telemetry tracking via `modtm`.
- Comprehensive examples for OpenAI, AI Service, Document Intelligence, CMK, Private Endpoints, and RAI policies.
